.TH L10N-CI 1 "February 2026" "l10n-ci 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
l10n-ci \- GitHub Action for localization CI/CD workflows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-ci
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l10n-ci
is a GitHub Action and command-line tool for automating localization CI/CD workflows with Transifex.
It synchronizes translation files between your repository and Transifex, automatically pulling
updated translations and pushing source file changes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-token " " \fITOKEN\fR
Transifex API token (required)
.TP
.BR \-\-source\-file " " \fIFILE\fR
Source file pattern (default: po/*.pot)
.TP
.BR \-\-min\-percentage " " \fIN\fR
Minimum translation percentage to pull (default: 10)
.TP
.BR \-\-commit\-message " " \fIMESSAGE\fR
Commit message for translation updates (default: "i18n: sync translations from Transifex")
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Sync translations with default settings:
.B l10n-ci --token YOUR_TX_TOKEN
.TP
Set custom minimum percentage:
.B l10n-ci --token YOUR_TX_TOKEN --min-percentage 50
